udies of ravulizumab intravenous in participants with PNH into the extension period of this study and received weight-based doses of ravulizumab for up to 5 years."},{"id":"BG004","title":"Total","description":"Total of all reporting groups"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"125"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"121"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"24"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"2"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"272"}]}],"measures":[{"title":"Age, Categorical","paramType":"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS","unitOfMeasure":"Participants","classes":[{"categories":[{"title":"<=18 years","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"2"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"2"}]},{"title":"Between 18 and 65 years","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"111"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"103"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"22"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"236"}]},{"title":">=65 years","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"14"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"18"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"2"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"34"}]}]}]},{"title":"Sex: Female, Male","paramType":"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS","unitOfMeasure":"Participants","classes":[{"categories":[{"title":"Female","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"60"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"52"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"12"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"1"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"125"}]},{"title":"Male","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"65"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"69"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"12"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"1"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"147"}]}]}]},{"title":"Ethnicity (NIH/OMB)","paramType":"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS","unitOfMeasure":"Participants","classes":[{"categories":[{"title":"Hispanic or Latino","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"5"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"13"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"6"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"2"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"26"}]},{"title":"Not Hispanic or Latino","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"116"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"102"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"218"}]},{"title":"Unknown or Not Reported","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"4"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"6"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"18"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"28"}]}]}]},{"title":"Race (NIH/OMB)","paramType":"COUNT_OF_PARTICIPANTS","unitOfMeasure":"Participants","classes":[{"categories":[{"title":"American Indian or Alaska Native","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"1"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"1"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"2"}]},{"title":"Asian","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"72"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"57"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"1"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"130"}]},{"title":"Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"0"}]},{"title":"Black or African American","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"2"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"4"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"6"}]},{"title":"White","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"43"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"51"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"11"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"2"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"107"}]},{"title":"More than one race","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"0"}]},{"title":"Unknown or Not Reported","measurements":[{"groupId":"BG000","value":"7"},{"groupId":"BG001","value":"8"},{"groupId":"BG002","value":"12"},{"groupId":"BG003","value":"0"},{"groupId":"BG004","value":"27"}]}]}]}]},"outcomeMeasuresModule":{"outcomeMeasures":[{"type":"PRIMARY","title":"Proportion Of Participants With Normalization Of Lactate Dehydrogenase (LDH) Levels","description":"LDH is an indicator of intravascular hemolysis that occurs in participants with paroxysmal nocturnal hemoglobinuria (PNH). A decrease in LDH from above the upper limit of normal (ULN) to below the ULN indicates reduction (improvement) in hemolysis. Normalization of LDH levels (LDH-N) was LDH levels less than or equal to 1 x ULN, from Day 29 through Day 183. The ULN for LDH is 246 U/L.","populationDescription":"Full Analysis Set: All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug (ravulizumab or eculizumab) and had at least 1 efficacy assessment after the first infusion of study drug.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"NUMBER","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"proportion of participants","timeFrame":"Day 29 through Day 183","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Ravulizumab","description":"Participants received weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 2400 to 3000 mg on Day 1. Thereafter, weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 3000 to 3600 mg were administered on Day 15 and every 8 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Eculizumab","description":"Participants received 600 mg of eculizumab on Days 1, 8, 15, and 22, followed by 900 mg of eculizumab on Day 29 and every 2 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"125"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"121"}]}],"classes":[{"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"0.536","lowerLimit":"0.459","upperLimit":"0.612"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"0.494","lowerLimit":"0.417","upperLimit":"0.570"}]}]}],"analyses":[{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"groupDescription":"A minimum of 142 participants were estimated to provide 80% power to demonstrate noninferiority of ravulizumab to eculizumab.","nonInferiorityType":"NON_INFERIORITY","nonInferiorityComment":"LDH-N was analyzed using a generalized estimating equation (GEE) approach. The model included the following terms: treatment group, history of transfusion (as a categorical variable based on the stratification factor levels), and baseline LDH level (as a continuous variable). Noninferiority margin was based on the lower bound of the 95% confidence interval (CI) for the odds ratio (OR) of ravulizumab versus eculizumab for LDH normalization being greater than an OR of 0.39.","paramType":"Odds Ratio (OR)","paramValue":"1.187","ciPctValue":"95","ciNumSides":"TWO_SIDED","ciLowerLimit":"0.796","ciUpperLimit":"1.769"}]},{"type":"PRIMARY","title":"Percentage Of Participants Who Achieved Transfusion Avoidance (TA)","description":"Transfusion avoidance was defined as the percentage of participants who remained transfusion free and did not require a transfusion per protocol-specified guidelines through Day 183.","populationDescription":"Full Analysis Set: All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug (ravulizumab or eculizumab) and had at least 1 efficacy assessment after the first infusion of study drug.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"NUMBER","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"percentage of participants","timeFrame":"Baseline through Day 183","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Ravulizumab","description":"Participants received weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 2400 to 3000 mg on Day 1. Thereafter, weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 3000 to 3600 mg were administered on Day 15 and every 8 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Eculizumab","description":"Participants received 600 mg of eculizumab on Days 1, 8, 15, and 22, followed by 900 mg of eculizumab on Day 29 and every 2 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"125"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"121"}]}],"classes":[{"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"73.6","lowerLimit":"65.87","upperLimit":"81.33"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"66.1","lowerLimit":"57.68","upperLimit":"74.55"}]}]}],"analyses":[{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"groupDescription":"A minimum of 193 participants were estimated to provide 80% power to demonstrate noninferiority of ravulizumab to eculizumab. The difference of percentages were calculated using stratified Newcombe CI method. Stratification factors were: observed stratification groups of packed red blood cells (pRBC)/whole blood units transfused in the 1 year prior to first dose of study drug and screening LDH levels.","nonInferiorityType":"NON_INFERIORITY","nonInferiorityComment":"Noninferiority margin was based on the lower bound of the 95% CI. Noninferiority margin was -20%.","paramType":"Treatment difference","paramValue":"6.8","ciPctValue":"95","ciNumSides":"TWO_SIDED","ciLowerLimit":"-4.66","ciUpperLimit":"18.14","estimateComment":"Treatment difference was estimated for ravulizumab - eculizumab."}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Percentage Of Participants With Breakthrough Hemolysis (BTH)","description":"Breakthrough hemolysis was defined as at least 1 new or worsening symptom or sign of intravascular hemolysis (fatigue, hemoglobinuria, abdominal pain, shortness of breath \\[dyspnea\\], anemia \\[hemoglobin \\<10 gram/deciliter (g/dL)\\], major adverse vascular event \\[MAVE, including thrombosis\\], dysphagia, or erectile dysfunction) in the presence of elevated LDH ≥2 × ULN, after prior LDH reduction to \\<1.5 × ULN on therapy.","populationDescription":"Full Analysis Set: All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug (ravulizumab or eculizumab) and had at least 1 efficacy assessment after the first infusion of study drug.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"NUMBER","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"percentage of participants","timeFrame":"Baseline through Day 183","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Ravulizumab","description":"Participants received weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 2400 to 3000 mg on Day 1. Thereafter, weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 3000 to 3600 mg were administered on Day 15 and every 8 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Eculizumab","description":"Participants received 600 mg of eculizumab on Days 1, 8, 15, and 22, followed by 900 mg of eculizumab on Day 29 and every 2 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"125"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"121"}]}],"classes":[{"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"4.0","lowerLimit":"0.56","upperLimit":"7.44"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"10.7","lowerLimit":"5.23","upperLimit":"16.26"}]}]}],"analyses":[{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"groupDescription":"The difference of percentages was calculated using stratified Newcombe CI method. The stratification factors were: observed stratification groups of pRBC units transfused in the 1 year prior to first dose of study drug and screening LDH levels.","nonInferiorityType":"NON_INFERIORITY","nonInferiorityComment":"Noninferiority margin was based on the upper bound of the 95% CI. Noninferiority margin was 20%.","paramType":"Treatment difference","paramValue":"-6.7","ciPctValue":"95","ciNumSides":"TWO_SIDED","ciLowerLimit":"-14.21","ciUpperLimit":"0.18","estimateComment":"Treatment difference was estimated for ravulizumab - eculizumab."}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Percent Change From Baseline In LDH Levels","description":"Baseline is defined as the average of all available assessments of LDH levels prior to first study drug dose. Estimates are based on Mixed Model for Repeated Measures (MMRM) that includes treatment group, history of transfusion (as a categorical variable based on the stratification factor levels) and baseline LDH level (as a continuous variable), study visit and study visit by treatment group interaction. An unstructured covariance structure was used.","populationDescription":"Full Analysis Set: All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug (ravulizumab or eculizumab) and had at least 1 efficacy assessment after the first infusion of study drug.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"LEAST_SQUARES_MEAN","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"percent change","timeFrame":"Baseline, Day 183","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Ravulizumab","description":"Participants received weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 2400 to 3000 mg on Day 1. Thereafter, weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 3000 to 3600 mg were administered on Day 15 and every 8 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Eculizumab","description":"Participants received 600 mg of eculizumab on Days 1, 8, 15, and 22, followed by 900 mg of eculizumab on Day 29 and every 2 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"125"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"121"}]}],"classes":[{"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"-76.84","lowerLimit":"-79.96","upperLimit":"-73.73"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"-76.02","lowerLimit":"-79.20","upperLimit":"-72.83"}]}]}],"analyses":[{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"nonInferiorityType":"NON_INFERIORITY","nonInferiorityComment":"Noninferiority margin was based on the upper bound of the 95% CI. Noninferiority margin was 20%.","paramType":"Treatment difference","paramValue":"-0.83","ciPctValue":"95","ciNumSides":"TWO_SIDED","ciLowerLimit":"-5.21","ciUpperLimit":"3.56","estimateComment":"Treatment difference was estimated for ravulizumab - eculizumab."}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Change From Baseline In Quality Of Life As Assessed By The Functional Assessment Of Chronic Illness Therapy (FACIT)-Fatigue","description":"FACIT-Fatigue score ranges from 0 to 52, with a higher score indicating less fatigue. Baseline is defined as the last non-missing value prior to first dose of study drug. Estimates are based on MMRM that includes treatment group, the observed stratification randomization indicators (history of transfusion and LDH) and baseline FACIT-Fatigue level, study visit, and study visit by treatment group interaction. An unstructured covariance structure was used.","populationDescription":"Full Analysis Set: All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug (ravulizumab or eculizumab) and had at least 1 efficacy assessment after the first infusion of study drug.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"LEAST_SQUARES_MEAN","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"units on a scale","timeFrame":"Baseline, Day 183","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Ravulizumab","description":"Participants received weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 2400 to 3000 mg on Day 1. Thereafter, weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 3000 to 3600 mg were administered on Day 15 and every 8 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Eculizumab","description":"Participants received 600 mg of eculizumab on Days 1, 8, 15, and 22, followed by 900 mg of eculizumab on Day 29 and every 2 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"125"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"121"}]}],"classes":[{"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"7.07","lowerLimit":"5.55","upperLimit":"8.60"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"6.40","lowerLimit":"4.85","upperLimit":"7.96"}]}]}],"analyses":[{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"nonInferiorityType":"NON_INFERIORITY","nonInferiorityComment":"Noninferiority margin was based on the lower bound of the 95% CI. Noninferiority margin was -5%.","paramType":"Treatment difference","paramValue":"0.67","ciPctValue":"95","ciNumSides":"TWO_SIDED","ciLowerLimit":"-1.21","ciUpperLimit":"2.55","estimateComment":"Treatment difference was estimated for ravulizumab - eculizumab."}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Percentage Of Participants With Stabilized Hemoglobin Levels","description":"Stabilized hemoglobin was defined as avoidance of a ≥2 g/dL decrease in hemoglobin level from baseline in the absence of transfusion through Day 183.","populationDescription":"Full Analysis Set: All participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug (ravulizumab or eculizumab) and had at least 1 efficacy assessment after the first infusion of study drug.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"NUMBER","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"percentage of participants","timeFrame":"Baseline through Day 183","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Ravulizumab","description":"Participants received weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 2400 to 3000 mg on Day 1. Thereafter, weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 3000 to 3600 mg were administered on Day 15 and every 8 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Eculizumab","description":"Participants received 600 mg of eculizumab on Days 1, 8, 15, and 22, followed by 900 mg of eculizumab on Day 29 and every 2 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"125"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"121"}]}],"classes":[{"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"68.0","lowerLimit":"59.82","upperLimit":"76.18"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"64.5","lowerLimit":"55.93","upperLimit":"72.99"}]}]}],"analyses":[{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"groupDescription":"The difference of percentages was calculated using stratified Newcombe CI method. The stratification factors were: observed stratification groups of pRBC units transfused in the 1 year prior to first dose of study drug and screening LDH levels.","nonInferiorityType":"NON_INFERIORITY","nonInferiorityComment":"Noninferiority margin was based on the lower bound of the 95% CI. Noninferiority margin was -20%.","paramType":"Treatment difference","paramValue":"2.9","ciPctValue":"95","ciNumSides":"TWO_SIDED","ciLowerLimit":"-8.80","ciUpperLimit":"14.64","estimateComment":"Treatment difference was estimated for ravulizumab - eculizumab."}]}]},"adverseEventsModule":{"frequencyThreshold":"5","timeFrame":"Baseline up to Day 2045","description":"Treatment-emergent adverse events (TEAEs) reported below include TEAEs that occurred during or after first infusion of study treatment up to Day 2045 (end of study).","eventGroups":[{"id":"EG000","title":"Ravulizumab: Primary Evaluation","description":"Participants received weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 2400 to 3000 mg on Day 1. Thereafter, weight-based doses of ravulizumab ranging from 3000 to 3600 mg were administered on Day 15 and every 8 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks.","deathsNumAffected":0,"deathsNumAtRisk":125,"seriousNumAffected":11,"seriousNumAtRisk":125,"otherNumAffected":87,"otherNumAtRisk":125},{"id":"EG001","title":"Eculizumab: Primary Evaluation","description":"Participants received 600 mg of eculizumab on Days 1, 8, 15, and 22, followed by 900 mg of eculizumab on Day 29 and every 2 weeks thereafter for 26 weeks.","deathsNumAffected":0,"deathsNumAtRisk":121,"seriousNumAffected":9,"seriousNumAtRisk":121,"otherNumAffected":86,"otherNumAtRisk":121},{"id":"EG002","title":"Ravulizumab/Ravulizumab: Extension Period","description":"After completion of the Primary Evaluation Period, all participants had the opportunity to enter the Extension Period, wherein participants received weight-based doses of ravulizumab for up to 5 years.","deathsNumAffected":4,"deathsNumAtRisk":124,"seriousNumAffected":52,"seriousNumAtRisk":124,"otherNumAffected":102,"otherNumAtRisk":124},{"id":"EG003","title":"Eculizumab/Ravulizumab: Extension Period","description":"After completion of the Primary Evaluation Period, all participants had the opportunity to enter the Extension Period, wherein participants received weight-b