900 mg on Day 29 and every 4 weeks thereafter"},{"id":"OG001","title":"ALXN1210 Cohort 2","description":"Induction phase: 600 mg on Day 1, 900 mg on Day 15 Maintenance phase: the first of 5 doses of 1800 mg on Day 29 and every 4 weeks thereafter"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"6"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Day 169","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"6"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"40.0000","spread":"55.13620"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"17.1429","spread":"45.35574"}]}]},{"title":"Day 1821","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"5"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"4"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"72.0000","spread":"144.81022"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"62.5000","spread":"125.00000"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Percent Change In Reticulocyte/Erythrocyte Count From Baseline To Day 169 And Day 1821","description":"Baseline was defined as the last non-missing assessment value prior to the first ALXN1210 infusion.","populationDescription":"The full analysis set included all enrolled participants who received at least 1 dose of ALXN1210 and who had a Baseline measurement with at least 1 reticulocyte/erythrocyte count measurement post-first ALXN1210 dose. Data were summarized only for participants with assessment at Baseline and the specified time point.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"MEAN","dispersionType":"Standard Deviation","unitOfMeasure":"percent change","timeFrame":"Baseline, Day 169, Day 1821","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"ALXN1210 Cohort 1","description":"Induction phase: a) 400 milligram (mg) on Day 1 and Day 8, 600 mg on Day 15; or b) 600 mg on Day 1, 600 mg on Day 15 Maintenance phase: the first of 5 doses of 900 mg on Day 29 and every 4 weeks thereafter"},{"id":"OG001","title":"ALXN1210 Cohort 2","description":"Induction phase: 600 mg on Day 1, 900 mg on Day 15 Maintenance phase: the first of 5 doses of 1800 mg on Day 29 and every 4 weeks thereafter"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"6"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Day 169","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"6"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"-21.203","spread":"14.1461"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"28.784","spread":"54.2636"}]}]},{"title":"Day 1821","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"5"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"4"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"-32.736","spread":"18.8997"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"9.763","spread":"22.5892"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Percent Change In Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria (PNH) Red Blood Cell (RBC) Clones From Baseline To Day 169 And Day 1933","description":"Baseline was defined as the last non-missing assessment value prior to the first ALXN1210 infusion.","populationDescription":"The full analysis set included all enrolled participants who received at least 1 dose of ALXN1210 and who had a Baseline measurement with at least 1 PNH RBC clones measurement post-first ALXN1210 dose. Data were summarized only for participants with assessment at Baseline and the specified time point.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"MEAN","dispersionType":"Standard Deviation","unitOfMeasure":"percent change","timeFrame":"Baseline, Day 169, Day 1933","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"ALXN1210 Cohort 1","description":"Induction phase: a) 400 milligram (mg) on Day 1 and Day 8, 600 mg on Day 15; or b) 600 mg on Day 1, 600 mg on Day 15 Maintenance phase: the first of 5 doses of 900 mg on Day 29 and every 4 weeks thereafter"},{"id":"OG001","title":"ALXN1210 Cohort 2","description":"Induction phase: 600 mg on Day 1, 900 mg on Day 15 Maintenance phase: the first of 5 doses of 1800 mg on Day 29 and every 4 weeks thereafter"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"6"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Day 169","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"6"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"7"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"7.873","spread":"19.3064"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"25.840","spread":"62.9677"}]}]},{"title":"Day 1933","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"3"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"2"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"15.927","spread":"34.8796"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"13.960","spread":"78.9414"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Percent Change In D-dimer Levels From Baseline To Day 169 And Day 1821","description":"Baseline was defined as the last non-missing assessment value prior to the first ALXN1210 infusion.","populationDescription":"The full analysis set included all enrolled participants who received at least 1 dose of ALXN1210 and who had a Baseline measurement with at least 1 D-dimer measurement post-first ALXN1210 dose. Data were summarized only for participants with assessment at Baseline and the specified time point.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"MEAN","dispersionType":"Standard Deviation","unitOfMeasure":"percent change","timeFrame":"Baseline, Day 169, Day 1821","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"ALXN1210 Cohort 1","description":"Induction phase: a) 400 milligram (mg) on Day 1 and Day 8, 600 mg on Day 15; or b) 600 mg on Day 1, 600 mg on Day 15 Maintenance phase: the first of 5 doses of 900 mg on Day 29 and every 4 weeks thereafter"},{"id":"OG001","title":"ALXN1210 Cohort 2","description":"Induction phase: 600 mg on Day 1, 900 mg on Day 15 Maintenance phase: the first of 5 doses of 1800 mg on Day 29 and every 4 weeks thereafter"}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"6"},{"gro